,356,362,368,374,378,381,414],[229,230,231],"p",{},"Kinotic is a next-generation cloud operating system that abstracts away infrastructure complexity so developers and AI agents can focus on what matters: building great applications.",[233,234,236],"h2",{"id":235},"humane-representation-of-thought","Humane Representation of Thought",[229,238,239],{},"The rise of AI-assisted development has unlocked a new paradigm -- rapid iteration driven by natural-language intent and intelligent code generation. Kinotic is purpose-built for this paradigm. Whether a human developer or an AI agent is writing the code, Kinotic provides the guardrails, services, and runtime that turn quick prototypes into production-grade systems.",[233,241,243],{"id":242},"core-components","Core Components",[245,246,247,254,259,265],"ul",{},[248,249,250,253],"li",{},[251,252,5],"strong",{}," -- Applications that run on Kinotic OS. Today, Kinotic Apps are built with TypeScript running on Bun -- you write standard TypeScript for domain models, business logic, and UI, and the platform handles infrastructure, deployment, and scaling. Support for Go, Java, and Python backends is coming soon.",[248,255,256,258],{},[251,257,143],{}," -- The cloud operating system that runs your apps. It provides authentication, authorization, persistence, service mesh, observability, and deployment infrastructure out of the box.",[248,260,261,264],{},[251,262,263],{},"Kinotic OS Cloud"," -- A fully managed SaaS offering of Kinotic OS. No servers to provision, no infrastructure to maintain.",[248,266,267,270],{},[251,268,269],{},"Kinotic CLI"," -- The developer tool that ties it all together. Use it to initialize projects, define entities, generate service code, and deploy applications.",[233,272,274],{"id":273},"why-kinotic","Why Kinotic?",[276,277,278,294],"table",{},[279,280,281],"thead",{},[282,283,284,288,291],"tr",{},[285,286,287],"th",{},"Concern",[285,289,290],{},"Without Kinotic",[285,292,293],{},"With Kinotic",[295,296,297,309,324,335,346],"tbody",{},[282,298,299,303,306],{},[300,301,302],"td",{},"Authentication & Authorization",[300,304,305],{},"Wire up OIDC and session management yourself",[300,307,308],{},"Built in -- configure once, enforce everywhere",[282,310,311,313,316],{},[300,312,59],{},[300,314,315],{},"Choose a database, write migrations, build CRUD endpoints",[300,317,318,319,323],{},"Define entities, run ",[320,321,322],"code",{},"kinotic sync",", get a full service layer",[282,325,326,329,332],{},[300,327,328],{},"Service Mesh",[300,330,331],{},"Deploy sidecars, configure routing, handle retries",[300,333,334],{},"Automatic service discovery and RPC across the application",[282,336,337,340,343],{},[300,338,339],{},"CI\u002FCD",[300,341,342],{},"Maintain pipelines, container registries, rollout strategies",[300,344,345],{},"Handled by the platform",[282,347,348,350,353],{},[300,349,181],{},[300,351,352],{},"Instrument code, deploy collectors, build dashboards",[300,354,355],{},"SBOM generation, metrics, and tracing are included",[229,357,358,361],{},[251,359,360],{},"Rapid prototyping."," Go from an idea to a running application in minutes with the CLI and generated services.",[229,363,364,367],{},[251,365,366],{},"Enterprise-ready."," Software bill of materials and full observability mean you never have to rewrite for production.",[229,369,370,373],{},[251,371,372],{},"Internet scale."," The platform is designed to scale horizontally from day one.",[233,375,377],{"id":376},"what-these-docs-cover","What These Docs Cover",[229,379,380],{},"This documentation walks through everything you need to build and ship a Kinotic App:",[382,383,384,389,394,399,404,409],"ol",{},[248,385,386,388],{},[251,387,15],{}," -- Scaffold a project and persist your first entity in under five minutes.",[248,390,391,393],{},[251,392,19],{}," -- Understand how organizations, applications, projects, and artifacts fit together.",[248,395,396,398],{},[251,397,38],{}," -- Publish and consume services across your application.",[248,400,401,403],{},[251,402,59],{}," -- Define entities, configure indexes, and run queries.",[248,405,406,408],{},[251,407,92],{}," -- Set up authentication and authorization.",[248,410,411,413],{},[251,412,103],{}," -- Ship your application to Kinotic OS or Kinotic OS Cloud.",[229,415,416,417,420],{},"Ready to build something? Head to the ",[418,419,15],"a",{"href":16}," to create your first Kinotic App.",{"title":422,"searchDepth":423,"depth":423,"links":424},"",2,[425,426,427,428],{"id":235,"depth":423,"text":236},{"id":242,"depth":423,"text":243},{"id":273,"depth":423,"text":274},{"id":376,"depth":423,"text":377},"Learn what Kinotic is, why it exists, and how it helps developers and AI agents build enterprise-grade applications at scale.","md",null,{},true,{"title":11,"description":429},"kWAFExdJBuvap6cvr7VlVEwd-U_8NHeOdkZ707K3NTM",[431,437],{"title":15,"path":16,"stem":17,"description":438,"children":-1},"Get started building your first Kinotic App -- from a provisioned project to a running CRUD service in under five minutes.",1789529833638]